{"id":"0b6984b9517bd015","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure Sequence","display":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> (initial set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (omega-sequence candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S(c,x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\nc(0)=x\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S(c,x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\nc(0)=x\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recurrence now uses the upstream set-coded function predicate; the transitive closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is obtained by taking the union of the range of this iterated-union sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureSequence}_S(c,x)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\nc(0)=x\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3468","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-sequence]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}